  "description": "Our company has its roots in building fixies—the purest form of cycling. With that foundation, we’ve evolved our frames using high-quality Reynolds 525 steel for the frame for improved ride quality, strength, and responsiveness.\n\nOur TIG-welded steel construction ensures strong, reliable joints, paired with a well-balanced geometry suited for both track performance and hybrid, everyday riding.\n\nThe result is a ride that feels fast, stable, and comfortable—perfect for navigating city streets or longer mixed-terrain routes.\n\nThe new ZANSKAR 1.0 is our versatile tracklocross platform, now refined with upgraded features. It comes equipped with our signature Biplanar fork designed to handle additional load and luggage with confidence. With clearance for up to 37C tires and long-reach pivot brakes, it offers enhanced control, safety, and adaptability across varied riding conditions.\n\nFixed Gear and Single Speed. The Rear Hub is equipped with a Flip Flop Hub having a Fixed Gear Cog and a Freewheel.\n\nClick here to know about Fixed Gear Technology.",
